# Prompt Quality Scoring Agent (LangChain + Google Gemini)

This project implements a simple prompt quality scoring agent using **LangChain** and **Google Gemini**.

Given a text prompt, the agent evaluates:

- Clarity (0–10)
- Specificity / Details (0–10)
- Context (0–10)
- Output Format & Constraints (0–10)
- Persona Defined (0–10)

It then computes a **final score** (average) and returns:

- A short explanation
- 2–3 improvement suggestions

The output is a **clean text report**, not JSON.

